    # ss "How? I had like three girlfriends who applied for that same job and never got a call back. "
    ss "Come? Avevo tipo tre amiche che hanno fatto domanda per lo stesso lavoro e non sono mai state richiamate. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day1.rpy:498
translate italian tolawoffices_9a021f76:

    # pc "Really? "
    pc "Davvero? "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day1.rpy:499
translate italian tolawoffices_96260a19:

    # ss "Yeah, they said that the woman didn't even seem interested in hiring them. What did you do to get that job? "
    ss "Sì, hanno detto che quella donna non sembrava nemmeno interessata ad assumerle. Cosa hai fatto per ottenere quel lavoro? "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day1.rpy:500
translate italian tolawoffices_e9d53d74:

    # pc "Just walked in and asked for it. "
    pc "Sono semplicemente entrata e l’ho chiesto. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day1.rpy:501
translate italian tolawoffices_7886c317:

    # ss "Didn't perform any favors then? "
    ss "Non hai fatto nessun favore allora? "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day1.rpy:502
translate italian tolawoffices_1abd5f9d:

    # pc "What? No! Don't be gross. "
    pc "Cosa? No! Non essere volgare. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day1.rpy:503
translate italian tolawoffices_b2859774:

    # ss "Alright, sure. If you say so. "
    ss "Va bene, certo. Se lo dici tu. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day1.rpy:504
translate italian tolawoffices_578ec521:

    # "She looks at me suspiciously. "
    "Mi guarda con sospetto. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day1.rpy:505
translate italian tolawoffices_31bab525:

    # "I reach into her car and take out my bag that has the cell phone in it. "
    "Allungo la mano nella sua auto e tiro fuori la mia borsa con dentro il cellulare. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day1.rpy:506
translate italian tolawoffices_ed0d368e:

    # pc "Well, I'll see you at home. Thanks again for driving me around today. "
    pc "Beh, ci vediamo a casa. Grazie ancora per avermi accompagnata in giro oggi. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day1.rpy:509
translate italian tolawoffices_65fdee3e:

    # ss "Hey you still owe me gas money!"
    ss "Ehi, mi devi ancora i soldi per la benzina!"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day1.rpy:510
translate italian tolawoffices_e902b56c:

    # pc "Oh yeah, sorry. Will $10 do?"
    pc "Oh sì, scusa. Ti bastano 10 dollari?"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day1.rpy:511
translate italian tolawoffices_87ff94f5:

    # ss "That's fine."
    ss "Va bene."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day1.rpy:513
translate italian tolawoffices_1b7e7694:

    # "I hand her a ten from the little amount of money I have in my wallet."
    "Le porgo una banconota da dieci dai pochi soldi che ho nel portafoglio."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day1.rpy:514
translate italian tolawoffices_70e27b89:

    # ss "Alright, see you later."
    ss "Va bene, ci vediamo più tardi."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day1.rpy:517
translate italian tolawoffices_98bddef0:

    # ss "Yeah, yeah. See you later. "
    ss "Sì, sì. Ci vediamo più tardi. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day1.rpy:520
translate italian tolawoffices_afba32b7:

    # "She pulls out quickly and cuts off two people as she drives onto the busy road in front of the law offices. "
    "Lei parte di scatto e taglia la strada a due persone mentre si immette sulla strada trafficata davanti agli studi legali. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day1.rpy:521
translate italian tolawoffices_3e9feed9:

    # "I walk over to one of the company cars. They both look exactly the same – generic black sedans, a few years old, with slightly tinted windows."
    "Mi avvicino a una delle auto aziendali. Sono entrambe identiche: berline nere standard, di qualche anno fa, con i finestrini leggermente oscurati."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day1.rpy:522
translate italian tolawoffices_c65d2d31:

    # "I press the unlock button on the key fob and one of the cars beeps. I open the driver's side door and get inside."
    "Premo il pulsante di sblocco sul telecomando e una delle auto emette un bip. Apro la portiera del lato guida e salgo a bordo."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day1.rpy:525
translate italian tolawoffices_762489ab:

    # "The inside of the car is clean and smells a bit musty as if it hasn't been used for a while."
    "L’interno dell’auto è pulito e ha un odore un po’ di muffa, come se non venisse usata da un po’."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day1.rpy:526
translate italian tolawoffices_76a7ccb7:

    # "It is simple and not very flashy, but it will get me around until I can buy a car of my own."
    "È semplice e non molto appariscente, ma mi permetterà di spostarmi finché non potrò comprarmi un’auto tutta mia."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day1.rpy:527
translate italian tolawoffices_07e0ebfc:

    # "Actually, it is probably better than any car that I'd ever owned. I'd only had one car before - an old junker that my dad had gotten me."
    "In realtà, probabilmente è migliore di qualsiasi auto io abbia mai posseduto. Prima avevo avuto solo un’auto: un vecchio rottame che mi aveva procurato mio padre."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day1.rpy:528
translate italian tolawoffices_ff0881b6:

    # "It barely ran and needed constant work. I sold it off before going to Brazil. Then down there, I didn't have any form of transportation. I just walked everywhere. "
    "Funzionava a malapena e richiedeva continue riparazioni. L’ho venduta prima di partire per il Brasile. Lì, poi, non avevo alcun mezzo di trasporto. Andavo ovunque a piedi. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day1.rpy:529
translate italian tolawoffices_076df576:

    # "The car starts as soon as I turn the key, and once I back out onto the street it drives perfectly fine. It doesn't have much power, but enough to get me from place to place."
    "L’auto si avvia non appena giro la chiave e, una volta che esco in retromarcia sulla strada, va perfettamente bene. Non ha molta potenza, ma ne ha abbastanza per portarmi da un posto all’altro."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day1.rpy:530
translate italian tolawoffices_61f7e0fb:

    # "I would have taken the job even without the car, but now, not having to rely on somebody else to drive me around is the best feeling. "
    "Avrei accettato il lavoro anche senza l’auto, ma ora, non dover dipendere da qualcun altro per farmi accompagnare in giro è una sensazione fantastica. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day1.rpy:531
translate italian tolawoffices_5ba209a0:

    # "It's evening now. I have a little time left to do some things before heading home for the night, and I have the means to go anywhere I want."
    "È sera ormai. Mi resta un po’ di tempo per sbrigare alcune cose prima di tornare a casa per la notte, e ho i mezzi per andare ovunque voglia."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day1.rpy:532
translate italian tolawoffices_f228727e:

    # "I suddenly remember the park that I used to play at when I was younger and I wonder what it looks like now."
    "All’improvviso mi viene in mente il parco dove giocavo da piccolo e mi chiedo come sia adesso."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day1.rpy:533
translate italian tolawoffices_cfe242e6:

    # "There are plenty of places to go, and I have plenty of time to check out that park later. Where do I want to go NOW?"
    "Ci sono un sacco di posti dove andare, e ho tutto il tempo per dare un’occhiata a quel parco più tardi. Dove voglio andare ADESSO?"

translate italian strings:

    # game/Scenes/Prologue/day1.rpy:219
    old "What's wrong with us being in the same class?"
    new "Che c’è di male se siamo nella stessa classe?"

    # game/Scenes/Prologue/day1.rpy:221
    old "I hope so too. That would be horrible."
    new "Lo spero anch’io. Sarebbe orribile."

